[
  {
    "start": 7.35,
    "end": 9.578,
    "text": "My parents send me money from home."
  },
  {
    "start": 9.578,
    "end": 11.998,
    "text": "These days, my AI assistant spends it."
  },
  {
    "start": 11.998,
    "end": 14.29,
    "text": "So who checks what it actually buys?"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.35,
    "end": 17.83,
    "text": "Riya studies in Toronto."
  },
  {
    "start": 17.83,
    "end": 19.558,
    "text": "Her parents in Pune send her"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.558,
    "end": 21.223,
    "text": "lunch money through a bank."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.223,
    "end": 22.087,
    "text": "It takes days,"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.087,
    "end": 24.369,
    "text": "about six percent disappears in fees,"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.369,
    "end": 25.479,
    "text": "and once it lands,"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.479,
    "end": 27.7,
    "text": "nobody can say what it was spent on."
  },
  {
    "start": 28.35,
    "end": 29.579,
    "text": "These aren't feelings."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.579,
    "end": 31.59,
    "text": "The World Bank puts the average cost"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.59,
    "end": 33.657,
    "text": "of sending two hundred dollars at six"
  },
  {
    "start": 33.657,
    "end": 34.998,
    "text": "point three six percent,"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.998,
    "end": 36.562,
    "text": "and India's foreign ministry"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.562,
    "end": 38.238,
    "text": "counts close to one point nine"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.238,
    "end": 39.97,
    "text": "million Indian students abroad."
  },
  {
    "start": 40.35,
    "end": 42.64,
    "text": "And now her assistant orders for her."
  },
  {
    "start": 42.64,
    "end": 44.249,
    "text": "One line of menu text says"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.249,
    "end": 45.734,
    "text": "the regular is sold out,"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.734,
    "end": 47.096,
    "text": "and it buys the large."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.096,
    "end": 48.829,
    "text": "Every spending cap says yes,"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.829,
    "end": 50.685,
    "text": "because caps check the amount,"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.685,
    "end": 51.49,
    "text": "not the item."
  },
  {
    "start": 52.35,
    "end": 53.576,
    "text": "And it's documented."
  },
  {
    "start": 53.576,
    "end": 54.924,
    "text": "In the AgentLAB study,"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.924,
    "end": 57.191,
    "text": "injected text on product pages pushed"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.191,
    "end": 59.458,
    "text": "shopping agents toward options two to"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.458,
    "end": 61.113,
    "text": "three times more expensive."
  },
  {
    "start": 61.113,
    "end": 62.89,
    "text": "A Princeton and University of"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.89,
    "end": 64.667,
    "text": "Washington study found agents"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.667,
    "end": 66.75,
    "text": "favour pricier sponsored listings."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.0,
    "end": 68.623,
    "text": "Today's controls check the"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.623,
    "end": 69.871,
    "text": "store or the amount."
  },
  {
    "start": 69.871,
    "end": 70.931,
    "text": "Greenlight blocks"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.931,
    "end": 72.242,
    "text": "merchants by category"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.242,
    "end": 72.554,
    "text": "code."
  },
  {
    "start": 72.554,
    "end": 74.301,
    "text": "Stripe's agent tokens cap an"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.301,
    "end": 75.549,
    "text": "amount and a seller."
  },
  {
    "start": 75.549,
    "end": 77.047,
    "text": "Neither one checks which"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.047,
    "end": 78.42,
    "text": "item the agent picked."
  },
  {
    "start": 78.67,
    "end": 79.991,
    "text": "Caps answer how much,"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.991,
    "end": 81.877,
    "text": "and allowlists answer to whom."
  },
  {
    "start": 81.877,
    "end": 83.45,
    "text": "Tally answers which item,"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.45,
    "end": 84.833,
    "text": "at which signed price,"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.833,
    "end": 86.72,
    "text": "from which registered counter,"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.72,
    "end": 88.606,
    "text": "and it asks you when the agent"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.606,
    "end": 89.99,
    "text": "picks the pricier one."
  },
  {
    "start": 90.24,
    "end": 91.968,
    "text": "Teen cards control the store."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.968,
    "end": 94.292,
    "text": "Agent payment schemes control the cart."
  },
  {
    "start": 94.292,
    "end": 95.782,
    "text": "Nobody controls the item,"
  },
  {
    "start": 95.782,
    "end": 97.45,
    "text": "or the agent's choice of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 97.7,
    "end": 98.402,
    "text": "Meet Tally."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.402,
    "end": 100.51,
    "text": "Pocket money that can't be talked"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.51,
    "end": 102.042,
    "text": "into the wrong purchase."
  },
  {
    "start": 102.042,
    "end": 103.0,
    "text": "Built on Monad."
  },
  {
    "start": 107.35,
    "end": 109.339,
    "text": "Riya signs up with Face ID."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.339,
    "end": 112.211,
    "text": "Mera turns one passkey into three keys:"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.211,
    "end": 114.862,
    "text": "her account, her agent's capped key,"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.862,
    "end": 117.735,
    "text": "and a menu key if she ever runs a café."
  },
  {
    "start": 117.735,
    "end": 120.46,
    "text": "No seed phrase, no extension, no gas."
  },
  {
    "start": 121.35,
    "end": 123.917,
    "text": "She sets the rules once: coffee and food,"
  },
  {
    "start": 123.917,
    "end": 126.546,
    "text": "ten dollars a purchase, twenty-five a day."
  },
  {
    "start": 126.546,
    "end": 128.424,
    "text": "They live in a Monad contract,"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.424,
    "end": 130.49,
    "text": "and only her key can change them."
  },
  {
    "start": 133.35,
    "end": 135.162,
    "text": "At the counter she scans a"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.162,
    "end": 136.626,
    "text": "menu the café signed."
  },
  {
    "start": 136.626,
    "end": 137.95,
    "text": "She says oat latte."
  },
  {
    "start": 137.95,
    "end": 140.529,
    "text": "Her agent, behind a context firewall,"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.529,
    "end": 142.411,
    "text": "sees only items and prices,"
  },
  {
    "start": 142.411,
    "end": 144.154,
    "text": "picks the cheapest match,"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.154,
    "end": 146.454,
    "text": "and Tally's contract checks every"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.454,
    "end": 148.197,
    "text": "rule before a cent moves."
  },
  {
    "start": 148.197,
    "end": 149.8,
    "text": "Paid in under a second."
  },
  {
    "start": 151.35,
    "end": 153.983,
    "text": "If the agent is talked into the large one,"
  },
  {
    "start": 153.983,
    "end": 156.241,
    "text": "the contract won't let it pay alone."
  },
  {
    "start": 156.241,
    "end": 157.871,
    "text": "It's one dollar forty more"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.871,
    "end": 159.438,
    "text": "than the cheapest coffee,"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.438,
    "end": 161.57,
    "text": "so Tally waits for Riya's Face ID."
  },
  {
    "start": 166.35,
    "end": 168.628,
    "text": "Back in Pune, her mom opens a link,"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.628,
    "end": 169.995,
    "text": "uses her fingerprint,"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.995,
    "end": 172.404,
    "text": "and sends twenty dollars with a note:"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.404,
    "end": 173.836,
    "text": "for lunches this week."
  },
  {
    "start": 173.836,
    "end": 176.505,
    "text": "It arrives in about a second, in dollars,"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.505,
    "end": 178.328,
    "text": "and it can only be spent the"
  },
  {
    "start": 178.328,
    "end": 179.63,
    "text": "way the rules allow."
  },
  {
    "start": 182.35,
    "end": 184.091,
    "text": "Don't take our word for it."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.091,
    "end": 186.542,
    "text": "Attack your own agent: a fake counter,"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.542,
    "end": 189.251,
    "text": "a phantom fee, a doubled price, an upsell."
  },
  {
    "start": 189.251,
    "end": 191.058,
    "text": "All four reach the contract,"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.058,
    "end": 192.67,
    "text": "and all four are refused."
  },
  {
    "start": 196.35,
    "end": 197.296,
    "text": "Every payment,"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.296,
    "end": 199.053,
    "text": "top-up and blocked attempt"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.053,
    "end": 201.418,
    "text": "is on the record, indexed by Envio,"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.418,
    "end": 203.85,
    "text": "with points for real purchases only."
  },
  {
    "start": 208.35,
    "end": 209.588,
    "text": "Any café can join."
  },
  {
    "start": 209.588,
    "end": 211.787,
    "text": "The same passkey signs its menu,"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.787,
    "end": 213.575,
    "text": "and a bond that anyone can"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.575,
    "end": 215.5,
    "text": "slash keeps the menu honest."
  },
  {
    "start": 218.35,
    "end": 220.037,
    "text": "Here's how it fits together."
  },
  {
    "start": 220.037,
    "end": 221.904,
    "text": "One passkey gives the owner key"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.904,
    "end": 223.289,
    "text": "and a capped agent key."
  },
  {
    "start": 223.289,
    "end": 224.735,
    "text": "The café signs its menu."
  },
  {
    "start": 224.735,
    "end": 226.361,
    "text": "The agent proposes one item"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.361,
    "end": 227.746,
    "text": "from behind a firewall."
  },
  {
    "start": 227.746,
    "end": 228.891,
    "text": "Then a single Monad"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.891,
    "end": 230.216,
    "text": "transaction checks the"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.216,
    "end": 230.818,
    "text": "signature,"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.818,
    "end": 233.227,
    "text": "the Merkle proof for the item and price,"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.227,
    "end": 234.613,
    "text": "and the family's rules,"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.613,
    "end": 236.239,
    "text": "and pays only the counter's"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.239,
    "end": 237.383,
    "text": "registered account."
  },
  {
    "start": 237.383,
    "end": 239.07,
    "text": "Envio indexes every receipt."
  },
  {
    "start": 239.32,
    "end": 239.906,
    "text": "Why Monad?"
  },
  {
    "start": 239.906,
    "end": 241.898,
    "text": "Payments settle in under a second,"
  },
  {
    "start": 241.898,
    "end": 243.304,
    "text": "so tap and go is honest,"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.304,
    "end": 244.769,
    "text": "and fees are small enough"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.769,
    "end": 246.058,
    "text": "for a two dollar chai."
  },
  {
    "start": 246.058,
    "end": 247.933,
    "text": "We even built our sponsor around"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.933,
    "end": 249.632,
    "text": "Monad's reserve balance rule,"
  },
  {
    "start": 249.632,
    "end": 251.097,
    "text": "sending each welcome in a"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.097,
    "end": 252.21,
    "text": "single transaction."
  },
  {
    "start": 252.46,
    "end": 253.505,
    "text": "And it's real."
  },
  {
    "start": 253.505,
    "end": 254.923,
    "text": "A Sourcify-verified"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.923,
    "end": 256.863,
    "text": "contract on Monad testnet,"
  },
  {
    "start": 256.863,
    "end": 259.027,
    "text": "thirty-two contract tests and"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.027,
    "end": 260.595,
    "text": "sixty-five app tests."
  },
  {
    "start": 260.595,
    "end": 263.58,
    "text": "Mera derives every key from one passkey."
  },
  {
    "start": 263.58,
    "end": 266.117,
    "text": "AUSD top-ups carry a purpose note."
  },
  {
    "start": 266.117,
    "end": 268.057,
    "text": "Envio indexes the history."
  },
  {
    "start": 268.057,
    "end": 270.222,
    "text": "Kimi picks behind a firewall."
  },
  {
    "start": 270.222,
    "end": 272.087,
    "text": "And it runs as an Android"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.087,
    "end": 273.58,
    "text": "app on a real phone."
  },
  {
    "start": 278.35,
    "end": 280.367,
    "text": "Greenlight controls the store."
  },
  {
    "start": 280.367,
    "end": 281.846,
    "text": "AP2 controls the cart."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.846,
    "end": 283.46,
    "text": "Tally controls the item."
  }
]
